<item><title>CIPRES trains social-protection officials in new management tools</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/cipres-trains-social-protection-officials-in-new-management-415cf7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/cipres-trains-social-protection-officials-in-new-management-415cf7/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>About a hundred officials are attending the 23-27 November seminar in Abidjan, which aims to spread revised accounting and pension-management rules.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:16:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ivory Coast health chief says families owe nothing to receive stillborn babies</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-health-chief-says-families-owe-nothing-to-c84775/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-health-chief-says-families-owe-nothing-to-c84775/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>Dr Kouakoussui Konan Lambert says hospitals will notify police before transferring each body to the morgue and funeral services.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:48:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ivory Coast plans to strengthen strategic oil reserves</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-plans-to-strengthen-strategic-oil-reserves-9afe02/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-plans-to-strengthen-strategic-oil-reserves-9afe02/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The country raised reserve capacity at an Abidjan energy and extractives forum, citing the role of stocks during supply disruptions.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:01:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ivory Coast&apos;s power company reports outages in Abidjan and inland towns</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-s-power-company-reports-outages-in-abidjan-and-b050de/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-s-power-company-reports-outages-in-abidjan-and-b050de/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The Compagnie ivoirienne d&apos;électricité said an incident on its high-voltage grid disrupted supply in some Abidjan communes and several inland areas.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:33:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-s-power-company-reports-outages-in-abidjan-and-b050de/share.jpg" length="45779" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-s-power-company-reports-outages-in-abidjan-and-b050de/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>German president Steinmeier holds economic talks with Ouattara in Abidjan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/german-president-steinmeier-holds-economic-talks-with-ddc492/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/german-president-steinmeier-holds-economic-talks-with-ddc492/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The visit is the first by a German president to Côte d’Ivoire in more than 40 years, and it is the first stop of a tour that also takes him to Ghana and Kenya.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:48:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
